mod.mod:
In section 1087(1)(gd) of the Companies Act 2006

2006 c. 46. Section 1087(1)(gd) was inserted by section 69 of the Economic Crime and Corporate Transparency Act 2023.
									 at the appropriate places insert—



section 790LN(2);


									;

p.mod:
for the definition of “section 243 application” substitute—



section 243 application means an application under section 243(4) (permitted disclosure by the registrar) for the purpose of requiring the registrar to refrain from disclosing protected information relating to a director to a credit reference agency;


											;

for paragraph 6(1)(c)(i) substitute—

												(i)


section 1112 (false statements: basic offence) or section 1112A (false statements: aggravated offence) of the Act or section 2 of the Fraud Act 2006 (fraud by false representation);


											;

for sub-paragraph (2) substitute—

												(2)


In section 790ZF(1), for “sections 240 to 244” substitute “sections 240 to 242 and 243(2) and (7)”;

for paragraph (ca) substitute—

												(ca)


sections 1087A, 1087B(1) and (2) and 1087C (protection of date of birth information);


											;

for sub-paragraph (c)(i) substitute—

													(i)


section 1112 (false statements: basic offence) or section 1112A (false statements: aggravated offence) of the Act or section 2 of the Fraud Act 2006 (fraud by false representation);


												;
